    "title": "Drivers: How to add a note to a stop",
    "metadata": {
        "url": "https://beansai.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/4839751949975.json",
        "html_url": "https://beansai.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4839751949975-Drivers-How-to-add-a-note-to-a-stop",
