    },
    "body": "1.  In the app, go to the deliver tab.  2.  Click on the pin/stop where you want to add a note.  Click on the “Info” button.   3.  Drag the Info screen up.  You can choose from Parking, Entrance, Elevator, or enter your own note; you can also include pictures by clicking the “add photo” icon.     .     4.  Click “Save.”",
